<title>THAILAND: Thai M-2 money supply up 14.2 pct yr/yr in Aug.</title>
<headline>Thai M-2 money supply up 14.2 pct yr/yr in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose 14.2 percent year on year in August against a revised 16.1 percent in July, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure rose to an estimated 3.55 trillion baht in August from 3.54 trillion in July.</p>
<p>    M-2			Aug 96     July 96	   Aug 95</p>
<p>    Money supply	    3.55	3.54		 3.11</p>
<p>    Percentage change     14.2	16.1		 18.8</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht. The Bank of Thailand said August figure was an estimate.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950/3</p>
</text>
